{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_07",
  "title": "永恆絢爛的藏品",
  "storyCode": "SS-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "39d200fbcdc18d429337a01ae9e6a0e972a1455315afadfd23faefe10018f447",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "祥子的琴彈得越來越好了啊~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有、有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "祥子的變化，我當然清楚，畢竟我是你的媽媽啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我能聽出來，祥子一直都很努力，即使在外辛苦工作，也從來沒有忘記練琴哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "感覺祥子在外面經歷了很多呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雖然很不想打擾你們練琴，但飯已經煮好囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔——好吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼樣？我的手藝進步了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你都不知道……他逼我試吃了多少次，才有現在這個味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "吃吃看這盤沙拉，味道怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔，很好吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為了能讓祥子喜歡，我微調了好幾次口味哦！還不錯吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "還有很多祥子也會喜歡的菜哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃……呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "祥子？祥子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不知不覺，吃得有點多……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在有沒有好一點……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不好意思，是我沒控制住，做太多菜了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真是的，你爸爸就是這樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過這就是他的行事風格，大部分的時候也蠻可愛的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "祥子，你會原諒他的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他真的很愛你哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我真的很愛你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽，怎麼突然這麼說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你出遠門的這段時間，我開始越來越頻繁地翻相簿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "從你出生時的照片，翻到一歲、兩歲、三歲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "難道都不是我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒有哦。在父母的眼中，孩子永遠是最重要、最特殊的存在哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你剛出生的時候，手掌只有我的一半不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但現在你看，已經比我的手還大一點點啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "母親拉起祥子的手，將兩人的掌心慢慢對齊。\n不知為何，祥子用五指緊緊地扣住了媽媽的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽，你的手好溫暖……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，我在喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "想哭也沒關係哦。你以前哭的時候，我也是這樣安慰你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸……我以前有那麼愛哭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在你很小很小的時候吧，那個時候祥子常常為了一顆糖果又哭又鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雖然祥子現在是個堅強的孩子，但那個時候真的是一個愛哭鬼呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是、是嗎，我一點都不記得了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，媽媽沒有騙你哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那……媽媽，你還記得我的高中入學典禮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然啊，我還記得那天你穿著制服，我們一家還在校門口合照呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好像是呢……真令人懷念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們以前，還經歷過哪些事？媽媽……我想聽你講，關於我們的回憶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "祥子，你是不是離開家裡太久了？怎麼今天這麼黏人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "家……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯……既然你想聽，那我就再回憶一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "從什麼時候開始講呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "從我出生的時候開始吧，我想一直聽下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好，那就從你的出生開始講吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就這樣，在田間小路上，母女二人肩並著肩，以不快不慢的速度走著，彷彿可以一直這樣走下去。\n就像她們最開始的那段美好時光一樣，不慌不忙，沒有戛然而止。\n她們的手，就像最開始連接兩人的那根臍帶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "祥子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你找到回家的路了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "紅豆小姐，這台車好像故障了，請你快點放我下來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看看……怎、怎麼和在羅德島上學的操作方法不一樣啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不行不行，已經停不下來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要撞上了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "祥子，你們快點閃開——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
